71.68], ["the", 71.68, 71.78], ["link", 71.78, 72.0], ["below.", 72.0, 72.34], ["90", 72.6, 72.84], ["-day", 72.84, 73.12], ["money", 73.12, 73.38], ["-back", 73.38, 73.64], ["guarantee,", 73.64, 74.18], ["no", 74.52, 74.68], ["return", 74.68, 75.04], ["required.", 75.04, 75.34]], "segments": [[0.0, 2.62, "new hives at 47, no explanation."], [3.06, 4.28, "Nobody could tell me why."], [4.74, 7.78, "I'd wake up at 3 a.m. with scratches across my arms,"], [8.0, 10.52, "scratched in my sleep without even realizing it."], [10.6, 12.8, "And there's a difference between seasonal allergies"], [12.8, 15.82, "and waking up at 47 covered in hives"], [15.82, 17.68, "you've never had before in your life."], [17.94, 20.74, "I switched my detergent, I tried antihistamines,"], [20.98, 23.48, "my doctor shrugged and said it was probably stress."], [23.84, 26.14, "None of it explained why this started now."], [26.38, 28.84, "Something changed and I couldn't stop asking"], [28.84, 30.0, "why now?"], [30.26, 32.06, "One thing I'd never thought to look at"], [32.06, 33.48, "was what I was sleeping on."], [33.7, 35.98, "Dust mites live deep inside mattress foam."], [36.2, 39.08, "Their allergens can trigger reactions in sensitized people."], [39.34, 41.7, "Though what's driving any individual's symptoms"], [41.7, 43.88, "is something only a doctor can work out."], [44.0, 45.68, "I'm not saying that's everyone's answer."], [45.9, 47.0, "I'm still working with mine."], [47.22, 49.66, "But capture cards gave me one physical thing"], [49.66, 50.92, "I could actually do."], [51.12, 53.4, "A plant-derived lure draws mites in,"], [53.6, 54.64, "they stick to the adhesive."], [54.92, 57.4, "You place four cards under the corners of your mattress,"], [57.4, 59.64, "weave them up to 90 days, then discard."], [59.96, 62.04, "In lab testing, capture cards captured"], [62.04, 64.6, "up to 99% of dust mites."], [64.68, 66.8, "It's not a cure, it's ruling something out."], [67.02, 69.18, "And that felt like the first concrete step"], [69.18, 70.38, "I could actually take."], [70.54, 72.34, "See capture cards at the link below."], [72.6, 75.34, "90-day money-back guarantee, no return required."]]}